[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00,000",
    "duration": 1.28,
    "characters": 21,
    "cps": 16.4,
    "text": "The task is finished."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:01,960",
    "duration": 0.98,
    "characters": 25,
    "cps": 25.5,
    "text": "The confirmation arrived."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:03,880",
    "duration": 0.8,
    "characters": 16,
    "cps": 20.0,
    "text": "But did it help?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05,340",
    "duration": 3.86,
    "characters": 66,
    "cps": 17.1,
    "text": "Before we talk about artificial intelligence, consider an ordinary"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09,200",
    "duration": 3.4,
    "characters": 52,
    "cps": 15.3,
    "text": "decision: arranging an outing for a group of people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13,833",
    "duration": 3.06,
    "characters": 55,
    "cps": 18.0,
    "text": "A volunteer reserves a room for a weekend group outing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17,693",
    "duration": 0.86,
    "characters": 25,
    "cps": 29.1,
    "text": "The booking is confirmed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19,313",
    "duration": 3.1,
    "characters": 62,
    "cps": 20.0,
    "text": "But the time conflicts with the last bus home for two members."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22,973",
    "duration": 2.14,
    "characters": 41,
    "cps": 19.2,
    "text": "They say they cannot attend at that time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26,625",
    "duration": 2.44,
    "characters": 41,
    "cps": 16.8,
    "text": "The volunteer can ask about another slot."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29,565",
    "duration": 2.92,
    "characters": 62,
    "cps": 21.2,
    "text": "Only the group coordinator can commit to changing the booking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33,345",
    "duration": 4.24,
    "characters": 75,
    "cps": 17.7,
    "text": "The coordinator says: The reservation succeeded, so the outing is arranged."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:38,917",
    "duration": 2.3,
    "characters": 33,
    "cps": 14.3,
    "text": "What should happen next, and why?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42,117",
    "duration": 3.24,
    "characters": 70,
    "cps": 21.6,
    "text": "Pause the video and write your decision before hearing the discussion."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46,237",
    "duration": 3.42,
    "characters": 70,
    "cps": 20.5,
    "text": "You can leave the final choice open if you explain what you still need"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49,657",
    "duration": 0.36,
    "characters": 8,
    "cps": 22.2,
    "text": "to know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50,528",
    "duration": 9.014,
    "characters": 54,
    "cps": 6.0,
    "text": "[Pause and write your answer. Take the time you need.]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59,542",
    "duration": 2.84,
    "characters": 52,
    "cps": 18.3,
    "text": "Would a small table help you explain this situation?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02,382",
    "duration": 3.8,
    "characters": 62,
    "cps": 16.3,
    "text": "Or would a written account preserve something the table loses?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07,302",
    "duration": 0.66,
    "characters": 16,
    "cps": 24.2,
    "text": "Either can work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08,922",
    "duration": 3.36,
    "characters": 58,
    "cps": 17.3,
    "text": "Keep the affected people and the unresolved facts in view."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15,750",
    "duration": 2.08,
    "characters": 38,
    "cps": 18.3,
    "text": "Here is one way to separate the facts."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18,770",
    "duration": 2.3,
    "characters": 48,
    "cps": 20.9,
    "text": "What happened: a room reservation was confirmed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21,770",
    "duration": 3.84,
    "characters": 66,
    "cps": 17.2,
    "text": "What people need: an outing the intended participants can actually"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25,610",
    "duration": 0.3,
    "characters": 7,
    "cps": 23.3,
    "text": "attend."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26,730",
    "duration": 3.18,
    "characters": 56,
    "cps": 17.6,
    "text": "What remains open: two members report a travel conflict."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30,670",
    "duration": 1.6,
    "characters": 34,
    "cps": 21.2,
    "text": "Other times and costs are unknown."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33,625",
    "duration": 3.8,
    "characters": 67,
    "cps": 17.6,
    "text": "The booking record supports a narrow claim: there is a reservation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:38,245",
    "duration": 2.1,
    "characters": 47,
    "cps": 22.4,
    "text": "It does not establish that everyone can attend."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:41,165",
    "duration": 3.92,
    "characters": 73,
    "cps": 18.6,
    "text": "A defensible next step is to ask about alternatives and hear the affected"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45,085",
    "duration": 3.04,
    "characters": 59,
    "cps": 19.4,
    "text": "members before promising that the outing is fully arranged."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49,667",
    "duration": 2.1,
    "characters": 30,
    "cps": 14.3,
    "text": "Now another organizer objects."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52,867",
    "duration": 1.86,
    "characters": 45,
    "cps": 24.2,
    "text": "People have already planned around this time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55,387",
    "duration": 3.36,
    "characters": 68,
    "cps": 20.2,
    "text": "Moving the outing could inconvenience them, or exclude someone else."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59,547",
    "duration": 0.92,
    "characters": 23,
    "cps": 25.0,
    "text": "That objection matters."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01,207",
    "duration": 3.48,
    "characters": 68,
    "cps": 19.5,
    "text": "Asking about alternatives does not yet justify changing the booking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06,083",
    "duration": 5.36,
    "characters": 73,
    "cps": 13.6,
    "text": "Compare a different time, travel support if it is feasible, postponement,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:11,983",
    "duration": 3.76,
    "characters": 67,
    "cps": 17.8,
    "text": "and keeping the booking with the exclusion explicitly acknowledged."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16,863",
    "duration": 2.06,
    "characters": 40,
    "cps": 19.4,
    "text": "Hear from the people who bear each cost."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:19,863",
    "duration": 1.96,
    "characters": 36,
    "cps": 18.4,
    "text": "The coordinator has a decision role."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22,543",
    "duration": 2.22,
    "characters": 42,
    "cps": 18.9,
    "text": "That role does not make every choice fair."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26,125",
    "duration": 1.54,
    "characters": 32,
    "cps": 20.8,
    "text": "What would change your judgment?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28,745",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "characters": 54,
    "cps": 18.0,
    "text": "Name a specific fact that could change your next step."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32,705",
    "duration": 1.48,
    "characters": 24,
    "cps": 16.2,
    "text": "Pause and write it down."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34,816",
    "duration": 8.017,
    "characters": 54,
    "cps": 6.7,
    "text": "[Pause and write your answer. Take the time you need.]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42,833",
    "duration": 4.3,
    "characters": 61,
    "cps": 14.2,
    "text": "Perhaps the two members identify an acceptable travel option."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47,873",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "characters": 51,
    "cps": 17.0,
    "text": "Perhaps a different time would exclude more people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51,933",
    "duration": 1.64,
    "characters": 37,
    "cps": 22.6,
    "text": "Neither is established in this story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54,273",
    "duration": 1.7,
    "characters": 34,
    "cps": 20.0,
    "text": "Either could change the next step."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56,733",
    "duration": 4.42,
    "characters": 77,
    "cps": 17.4,
    "text": "Neither would make the original confirmation proof that the whole arrangement"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01,153",
    "duration": 0.44,
    "characters": 7,
    "cps": 15.9,
    "text": "worked."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03,042",
    "duration": 3.28,
    "characters": 56,
    "cps": 17.1,
    "text": "A conversation and a list of alternatives may be enough."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07,122",
    "duration": 3.7,
    "characters": 67,
    "cps": 18.1,
    "text": "Changing a booking does not necessarily recover preparation time or"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:10,822",
    "duration": 0.86,
    "characters": 21,
    "cps": 24.4,
    "text": "missed participation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12,662",
    "duration": 4.1,
    "characters": 66,
    "cps": 16.1,
    "text": "This is the consequences lens we are starting with in SideFX: when"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16,762",
    "duration": 4.6,
    "characters": 68,
    "cps": 14.8,
    "text": "someone says a task is complete, ask which result they mean, and who"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21,362",
    "duration": 1.7,
    "characters": 32,
    "cps": 18.8,
    "text": "still cannot get what they need."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24,417",
    "duration": 2.76,
    "characters": 45,
    "cps": 16.3,
    "text": "Think of one completed task in your own work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27,897",
    "duration": 1.64,
    "characters": 39,
    "cps": 23.8,
    "text": "Whose result might still be unresolved?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30,697",
    "duration": 2.76,
    "characters": 60,
    "cps": 21.7,
    "text": "Describe the missing result and the evidence you would need."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34,297",
    "duration": 2.8,
    "characters": 44,
    "cps": 15.7,
    "text": "Next, we will ask: What do we actually know?"
  }
]